    "text": "1 days ago BARTHOLOMEW COUNTY, Ind. — One person died and three others were injured in a crash in Bartholomew County Tuesday afternoon. Emergency crews were called around 2:30 p.m. June 2 to the intersection of North 325 West and Lowell Road, just north of Columbus, for a crash involving one vehicle. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 6",
